      "message": "test(app): lathe_thread_travel builds and passes on main again\n\nTwo merges collided with #643's new test. #639 added `hand` to\nOpParams::Threading, and the test didn't set it (E0063). 53e4aebb moved\nthe built-in Lathe's X min to -2.5, so the over-travel fixture's string\nreplace no longer matched. The fixture now rewrites only the X max: the\nX stroke is the only one that reaches 320, since Z runs to +-615.\n\nFixes #711\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
